<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
  </head>
  <body>
    <h3>Welcome to Vardhan Agencies, <%= @user.full_name %></h3>
    <p>
      New Account created for you on <%=MySetting.find_by_name('host').value%> <br>
      Your username: <%= @user.username %><br>
      Your temporary password: <%=@user.password%> (Case Sensitive)
    </p>
    <p>
       Go to  <%=MySetting.find_by_name('host').value%> and enter the username and password given.
      <br>It will immediatly redirect you to change password page.
      <br>Please enter new password.
      <br>After changing the password you will be able to access the application.
    </p>

    Have a great day!<br><br>

    Regards<br>
    Vardhan Agencies, Sirsi

  </body>
</html>
